# Shared internal service secrets.
#
# Only values that every trusted internal Relay process needs belong here: the
# harness, the BFF, and the Tool Layer. Per-service secrets stay in that
# service's own .env so a process never reads a secret it does not need.
#
# Values are compared across services, so never copy one into both files.
.env.secrets

# Private notes live inside the checkout but are never committed.
Relay-notes/
docs/
todo.md

# Database migrations are applied; the repo does not own them.
supabase/

# Local artifacts and secrets.
.DS_Store
.lavish/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.env
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
.worktrees/
dist-server
.omb-scratch
.wrangler/
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
.claude/worktrees/
.vercel/
.pi/

# Release signing material never enters this repository.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12

# Local app environment.
/.env
